    "hash_1392e19ed5299e3c": "^1Al-Qatala Fighter 1:^7 Fire!",
    "hash_2bd517cfb867ec3a": "^1Al-Qatala Fighter 2:^7 I'll kill her! I'll fucking kill her!",
    "hash_750d7cb1c3919bc4": "Alejandro",
    "hash_5400c5e4674d21b3": "Cartel Ambusher 1",
    "hash_5400c6e4674d2366": "Cartel Ambusher 2",
    "hash_1ddd25f403d4666f": "Cartel Member 6",
    "hash_1ddd24f403d464bc": "Cartel Member 7",
    "hash_3e80f14d241830fb": "Ghost",
    "hash_3cd100ec3dd4e32a": "Graves",
    "hash_55075989d391a0b8": "Laswell",
    "hash_1382d016579e806a": "Mexican Army Officer",
    "hash_4262516b00e31fc9": "N\xc3\xba\xc3\xb1ez",
    "hash_eda98e5e6593049": "Rodolfo",
    "hash_9839e306796180f": "Rodriguez",
    "hash_6a2111cb85d93baf": "Shepherd",
    "hash_e45ffb5ac1f54bf": "Soap",
    "hash_22381355e32ef045": "Victor 2-1",
    "hash_1ed987a657150e25": "Fuck-! It\xe2\x80\x99s the army!",
    "hash_3c16f358077d2648": "They\xe2\x80\x99re not ours!",
    "hash_5b3e852f860c2226": "We have to hold 'em off & get extraction",
    "hash_507e3d80cf5bbf46": "We have to hold here & get extraction.",
    "hash_51da1fdc9a91489c": "Get to cover!",
    "hash_4b988ecd2e121ac2": "Vehicles on the bridge!",
    "hash_10c884ae1fd9b9b1": "We can\xe2\x80\x99t do shite against that armor!",
    "hash_1dfd5a2e795d9f74": "This way!",
    "hash_6218b9823c2d74d4": "Who the hell is that?",
    "hash_234981d185cc4a33": "Commander Graves, Shadow Company. They're with us.",
    "hash_6ac385854907a85e": "Likewise, mate.",
    "hash_5c7079196808d5ba": "Shadow-1, Bravo 0-7! Good shots! Fire for effect!",
    "hash_2998e0f8bcabb57d": "All stations, no enemy movement detected. You\xe2\x80\x99re clear.",
    "hash_38d76958c56e136a": "Copy, 0-7. Rounds away.",
    "hash_3174745c93df298c": "It's good to see you boys.",
    "hash_73f861c8e6340adf": "This is Shadow-1! Engaging the bridge north of your position. Danger close!",
    "hash_5587d0e269241a62": "Found a vehicle!",
    "hash_77f014e1a688b3f0": "\xc3\x81ndele! Hurry up, Sergeant!",
    "hash_169a5579a56b50c8": "I\xe2\x80\x99ll drive!",
    "hash_a8720879985ce0f": "C'mon, Soap, it\xe2\x80\x99s time to roll!",
    "hash_7cda2b99cb397c0b": "That\xe2\x80\x99s cartel land. They have a compound there.",
    "hash_484a0c0c1d99d932": "Load in!",
    "hash_d2d4ce7ec87efcf": "Graves, we\xe2\x80\x99ve located a vehicle for exfil.",
    "hash_48b4884ce3d4c8d8": "Shadow-1, stand by...",
    "hash_23cc634eac7344b4": "Johnny, get in the fuckin\xe2\x80\x99 vehicle.",
    "hash_7e1bbb027aacb0c5": "And we have a gunship.",
    "hash_13600d682956c1cf": "I can put fire where you need it if you boys are good to go on this capture\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_566e14f3bdcd0927": "Now, boys- you do not have to do this. You\xe2\x80\x99ve been through hell, no need to walk through more.",
    "hash_735566ec590b2868": "Roger that. Be advised, we got a possible hit on Hassan, two klicks north of your position.",
    "hash_76d0e1eab17083ca": "Roger that. Be advised, we\xe2\x80\x99re getting heavy SIGINT traffic two klicks north of your position. Could be Hassan.",
    "hash_5e1a4ea8e533d3d8": "Solid copy. Shadow is inbound to Hassan\xe2\x80\x99s location di-rectly. Out.",
    "hash_66a954dffc7f381a": "Solid copy. We are pushing to the target di-rectly. Shadow-1 out.",
    "hash_5b0c602adc139cee": "What\xe2\x80\x99s the call, boys? Still got some hunt left in ya?",
    "hash_f6747a3ddf6db6b": "You boys good to roll up Hassan with some fire from the sky?",
    "hash_684646f29d6b37a3": "Found a vehicle!",
    "hash_2308d8035609f8cb": "Hell yeah we do.",
    "hash_1671343e3609735f": "Let\xe2\x80\x99s roll.",
    "hash_47fcbe5ac0fd54f1": "Let\xe2\x80\x99s wrap this fucker up, Graves.",
    "hash_5eb724c8a842c5b1": "Get to the gate, Sergeant.",
    "hash_7baaab19a8db0b48": "Move.",
    "hash_632306fa139f5e6c": "Next gate, Soap.",
    "hash_6552d30a39970b29": "Soap, up here.",
    "hash_6d72e85cd43035a2": "Guys, here they come! Let\xe2\x80\x99s fuck them up!",
    "hash_74d0a9eacf5c893": "The rats are headed your way! I can hear them on the road.",
    "hash_344dc0cf1c960ed5": "Holding at the gate, Sergeant.",
    "hash_1ba54ccd271f02df": "Keep up, Soap.",
    "hash_31286527940a46d5": "Soap, we\xe2\x80\x99re at the gate.",
    "hash_10d40f6f8ba4ab94": "Mexican Special Forces confirmed. Hassan is moving something sizable towards the US. The cargo could be containers housing missiles. We don\xe2\x80\x99t know how many and we don\xe2\x80\x99t know the targets.",
    "hash_3e54c5e0806067e": "Hassan was taken back into cartel protection in Las Almas.",
    "hash_3120b9064579d6f0": "Understood, sir. Let\xe2\x80\x99s find Hassan\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_23b202292f8bcf54": "We can\xe2\x80\x99t start a war in Mexico, General\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_13f7a225f5270a59": "Certainly not\xe2\x80\x94 I\xe2\x80\x99ll task Phillip Graves and his Shadow Company PMCs to assist. Their rules of engagement can help us cut some red tape and get this done.",
    "hash_3e1952067e7e2700": "To find out, we need to capture Hassan and bring him in for interrogation. We\xe2\x80\x99ll send Soap and Ghost to link up with the Mexican Special Forces in country along with all the manpower they need.",
    "hash_530c2199b957722d": "Cartel took over. It\xe2\x80\x99s a hideout now.",
    "hash_63cca7b22f5df0e4": "Clear. Next gate.",
    "hash_3531893ff3b597d2": "Gone.",
    "hash_7d95dcd02784a29e": "Good place to keep Hassan.",
    "hash_5fb4d52d2aa7aa70": "Contact- all Victors move in!",
    "hash_55e7812097cdcd9": "Keep us moving, g\xc3\xbcey.",
    "hash_d9c783daee3a04c": "Push up.",
    "hash_24568be244a8315c": "Secure this house, then we go for Hassan.",
    "hash_24280273b6024b4f": "Take point, Soap.",
    "hash_5633f2ab3195e2c5": "Take the door.",
    "hash_5d22922cbac34134": "That way, Sergeant. Down the path.",
    "hash_6fc7574590c4f496": "Then we move faster.",
    "hash_392e015f7889492a": "They\xe2\x80\x99re down.",
    "hash_57239a6b85ce7729": "Mother fuckers!",
    "hash_621b50acef6a4060": "Get ready.",
    "hash_196dc4b844b5c84c": "Let\xe2\x80\x99s fuck \xe2\x80\x98em up\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_4658760a89279cce": "Cartel will move him fast.",
    "hash_6f9423eddef06355": "Move fast. Let\xe2\x80\x99s get Hassan.",
    "hash_31e59703b855d883": "Push up to the next corner.",
    "hash_12608144919aacc9": "You\xe2\x80\x99re up, Sergeant. Move.",
    "hash_404232defd92a181": "Copy. 2\xe2\x80\x99s moving!",
    "hash_5c4e40212e2f3287": "Clear.",
    "hash_2cf6b1d09e3dfe64": "All guns, hold here- take cover.",
    "hash_530e6cf664b43b56": "Any word from Rodolfo?",
    "hash_4990ba2c8e6affe8": "Control, this is Victor-1. How copy?",
    "hash_31dbf86106b933c4": "Control, Victor-1....",
    "hash_1fd4bf5a6814da7d": "For now, they\xe2\x80\x99ll be more. Vamos.",
    "hash_2470baf8d870bff9": "Ghost, Soap\xe2\x80\x94\xe2\x80\x94 Get behind the rocks\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_619427ffb540cade": "God help us.",
    "hash_4abc7649d402b957": "Let\xe2\x80\x99s hope so.",
    "hash_477eda3ffd7cea92": "Puta... Let\xe2\x80\x99s keep it moving. Through here.",
    "hash_1649c5195b24f014": "\xc2\xa1Disparen! Light them up-!",
    "hash_30ee403d10c52ae0": "Rodriguez, call for extract.",
    "hash_297766f266729b61": "Rodriguez, establish comms!",
    "hash_46bbd3f0d6acc980": "Rodriguez, get comms up!",
    "hash_2754c03d1acb0f1a": "Rodriguez, get the radio up!",
    "hash_66e38096a81c6add": "Soap, we\xe2\x80\x99re moving!",
    "hash_71562c557772a467": "Stay close, Sergeant!",
    "hash_58f80f9b1da2b62a": "The army is trailing us, Soap. Let\xe2\x80\x99s move.",
    "hash_282bedd8f2fec79f": "The mountain\xe2\x80\x99s blocking comms.",
    "hash_4e5220f37ad168b9": "There\xe2\x80\x99s a bridge at the river. Extraction will be there.",
    "hash_186d63ce023129f2": "Very well, but so does the army...",
    "hash_de8c18e6f932d94": "We need to get to the river!",
    "hash_6529cf5e0c6115a6": "We need to get to the river!",
    "hash_7768bb43da43e878": "We suppress by fire, then we advance\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_4b46fdae9ce9f941": "And if it isn\xe2\x80\x99t?",
    "hash_595c53852b2a1ad4": "Contact!",
    "hash_2163db8039f0bf07": "We can\xe2\x80\x99t hold off an army. We need extraction.",
    "hash_2bbb7391cbfc7b25": "We clear?",
    "hash_7798c29d4725d052": "Your man get the call out?",
    "hash_10046181a3574a92": "Control, do you copy?",
    "hash_5434fa24ff5d4888": "Control, Victor 1, request immediate extraction at Soul River Bridge, how copy?",
    "hash_28ceb6eda3fe0794": "I can\xe2\x80\x99t reach them, Colonel!",
    "hash_772e4be6003b7caa": "No - we lost comms.",
    "hash_3ddc08d7f3bd6853": "Yes, Colonel\xe2\x80\xa6!",
    "hash_70af5348cc814ab3": "Yes, Commander.",
    "hash_79468706ea8fd8b7": "What\xe2\x80\x99s the plan?",
    "hash_32388862fbb3da78": "You know these trails?",
    "hash_4660626050583225": "Escucha\xe2\x80\xa6 You hear that?",
    "hash_7e233bdae65f468d": "Negative, they\xe2\x80\x99re with the cartel!",
    "hash_7a55e1735ba3484b": "North. Towards that helo.",
    "hash_348386672fbcffaf": "Shit-! You\xe2\x80\x99re compromised!",
    "hash_36025956600c5018": "Si. Get to a firing position. We\xe2\x80\x99ll take them by surprise.",
    "hash_66d97e245498479f": "Straight ahead. Past the helo.",
    "hash_8497182e604ac18": "They\xe2\x80\x99ll try to cut us off.",
    "hash_53b4adff94d4bf2c": "They saw you! Engage!",
    "hash_29b7602c439b332": "Up the hill! The bridge isn\xe2\x80\x99t far!",
    "hash_71ae597b3d18bbe8": "Weapons free!",
    "hash_4e63a9d605310d25": "Weapons hot.",
    "hash_75db947fbe9e26f5": "Clear!",
    "hash_6dbeb445af11d49a": "Enemy reinforcements!",
    "hash_5bf399dc3452f030": "Engaging!",
    "hash_5e0a00e7ed108e70": "Goin\xe2\x80\x99 hot!",
    "hash_706c8bf072a5c214": "Incoming heli\xe2\x80\xa6",
    "hash_67c5041a0e0361fa": "Secondaries!",
    "hash_afb0153b5cd8589": "Soap, get up the hill, we\xe2\x80\x99re moving to extraction!",
    "hash_44d774223007488a": "Soap, get your glass on a target. We\xe2\x80\x99re standing by...",
    "hash_6e8434f6ac19f60": "Stay low and push up, Sergeant.",
    "hash_3f5d6142d4d3dd55": "Take \xe2\x80\x98em down!",
    "hash_39822f8551501e71": "Take the hill, Sergeant! Move!",
    "hash_c9aa58156741ecc": "Top o\xe2\x80\x99the hill, Sergeant! We\xe2\x80\x99re moving!",
    "hash_1696f515c862f78f": "We\xe2\x80\x99re ready to engage, Soap. Get up here.",
    "hash_672b99c1e2aa1f7d": "Which way to the bridge?",
    "hash_6dafd47c48fffa1": "Clear!",
    "hash_61feed870e531399": "Friendly?",
    "hash_760c97f1a3d44a63": "We'll have to go through them.",
    "hash_62e5b5b7e7b3b35a": "C\xe2\x80\x99mon, hermano, get on that ledge and scout the way up top.",
    "hash_54e7e23c03b29251": "Do or die, brother.",
    "hash_471877095c83ac64": "Get down to that first ledge, hermano. Then you start climbing.",
    "hash_56459d13adcf4f27": "Gotta climb this mountain fast, Sergeant.",
    "hash_6780991702e87b0c": "Grab that ledge above you, hermano.",
    "hash_13ab8d7527352a29": "Hold up!",
    "hash_f2a23da2bb5d231": "I grew up here, remember?",
    "hash_15fd4064d855255f": "Keep climbing. We\xe2\x80\x99re almost there.",
    "hash_21c2fb8cfd8f9497": "Negative. We need to get to the river.",
    "hash_629d841541776cde": "Next ledge, Soap.",
    "hash_579284023b2d659d": "Pinche cabrones aren\xe2\x80\x99t far behind.",
    "hash_2187b5be398c45c6": "Rodriguez, any radio signal?",
    "hash_508d0a5edb0c05a7": "Soap, jump down to the first ledge. You climb up from there.",
    "hash_23e100e5156eada1": "Soap push forward. Rodriguez, keep working the radio, rest o\xe2\x80\x99 you watch for snipers.",
